            "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Deck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/338a1b29dce75c0412962a69c74b5256.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/06200260023300b9354cf37aab162b32.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/06200260023300b9354cf37aab162b32.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/06200260023300b9354cf37aab162b32.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >APROVEITA. SOBREVIVE. REPETE</h2><br>J5T-1N, um robô operário, acaba de chegar à tua dimensão para avisar sobre o Imperium, uma força devastadora que trará ruína e caos.<br> Luta pela sobrevivência numa campanha emergente e gerada de forma processual, com combates por turnos táticos e reativos, que privilegiam interrupções e contra-ataques. Vais enfrentar um sistema de adversários inteligente, com oficiais inimigos que evoluem e podem ser promovidos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/a1b205f2c0ee6d0d62c776407884b8f7.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/a1b205f2c0ee6d0d62c776407884b8f7.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/a1b205f2c0ee6d0d62c776407884b8f7.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embora os teus heróis caiam na luta contra a invasão do Imperium, o J5T-1N é enviado para próxima dimensão com todo o conhecimento que adquiriu, dando uma hipótese de vitória a um novo grupo de heróis. Cada dimensão e partida são desafiantes e únicas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/445a21d0275a893cadf16bd64ee7b732.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/445a21d0275a893cadf16bd64ee7b732.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/445a21d0275a893cadf16bd64ee7b732.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARACTERÍSTICAS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Surpreende os teus inimigos com interrupções, contra-ataques e combos no sistema de combate reativo<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/5b38f8e9c3daff48417926b4696e8d6e.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/5b38f8e9c3daff48417926b4696e8d6e.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/5b38f8e9c3daff48417926b4696e8d6e.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Sobrevive ao massacre implacável do sistema de adversários inteligente, que gera inimigos e chefes únicos e que evoluem consoante jogas<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/e0765aa0c3715022c7fac8e280eba9dc.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/e0765aa0c3715022c7fac8e280eba9dc.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/e0765aa0c3715022c7fac8e280eba9dc.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Desbloqueia dezenas de personagens à medida que os sobreviventes do teu esquadrão criam laços e geram descendentes<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/a98e5ccb672b18157133981cd619dbd7.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/a98e5ccb672b18157133981cd619dbd7.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/a98e5ccb672b18157133981cd619dbd7.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Luta para chegar ao coração do Imperium numa experiência única. O Rebellion Engine cria cada partida com eventos e jogabilidade emergentes, missões geradas processualmente, prioridades dinâmicas, inimigos em constante evolução e imensos equipamentos e melhorias para o teu esquadrão.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/0e878e59d54332971fa95cd931068698.poster.avif?t=1766091161\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/0e878e59d54332971fa95cd931068698.webm?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651670/extras/0e878e59d54332971fa95cd931068698.mp4?t=1766091161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
