                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There is a good game buried in here under very questionable decisions.\r\n\r\nIt tries to be a rogue-like with RPG battles in the mix, but each run takes roughly 5 hours to complete on NORMAL difficulty. Everything is slow, combat is slow, animations are slow, progress is slow, there is too much downtime and useless mechanics/things to chew through to get to the actual gameplay.\r\n\r\nSpending 5 hours of your life to die at the very last fight because it keeps reviving the last boss just to be able to buy a single upgrade when you get back to the main hub is not fun. This game assumes you are willing to throw an entire evening of your life for very little meta progression.",
